      "text": "cessed prompt source derived from Anthropic HH-RLHF [Bai et al., 2022]; its dataset card\nhttps://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceH4/hh-rlhf lists the MIT license, and\nthe upstream Anthropic HH-RLHF dataset card https://huggingface.co/datasets/\nAnthropic/hh-rlhf is also MIT-licensed. We use this dataset only as a prompt distri-\nbution and do not redistribute a modified dataset. The policy is Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n[Qwen Team, 2024a,b], whose model card lists Apache-2.0. The OpenAssistant proxy\nreward models are DeBERTaV3-based [He et al., 2021] and their model cards list MIT\n",
